1. Clone the repository
2. Install Go 1.25.0 or later and GCC (SQLite requires CGO)
3. Install binaries to $GOPATH/bin

    env CGO_ENABLED=1 go install github.com/drone/drone/cmd/drone-server

   For a RHEL 8 amd64 binary, build on RHEL 8 / UBI 8 instead:

    bash scripts/build-rhel8.sh

   This writes dist/drone-server. See docs/lsf-runner.md for details.

4. Start the server at localhost:8080

    export DRONE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=...
    export DRONE_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=...
    drone-server
